{"ID":"20240506102402-tgdiwx6","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240506102402-tgdiwx6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506102402-tgdiwx6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506102402-d4yhr0s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613111051-85vpupt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:422,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613111123-066c6n1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"301女青（萝摩）","updated":"20240701150451"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240506102402-d4yhr0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240506102402-d4yhr0s","updated":"20240701150451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（缺）"}]},{"ID":"20240613111024-s8u3y9o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613111024-s8u3y9o"}},{"ID":"20240613111038-5g1cd44","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613111038-5g1cd44","updated":"20240613111043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女青《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613111038-ma5tjat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111038-ma5tjat","updated":"20240613111038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛平。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111038-w67pqpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111038-w67pqpg","updated":"20240613111038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主蛊毒，逐邪恶气，杀鬼温疟，辟不祥。一名雀瓢（《御览》作翾）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111038-60akuqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111038-60akuqm","updated":"20240613111038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：女青一名霍由祗，神农黄帝辛（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111038-b5pdfk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111038-b5pdfk6","updated":"20240613111038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：蛇衔根也，生朱崖，八月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111038-x1zs5az","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111038-x1zs5az","updated":"20240613111038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《广雅》云：女青，乌葛也。《尔雅》云：雚芄兰。郭璞云：雚芄蔓生。断之，有白汁可啖。《毛诗》云：芄兰之支。《传》云：芄兰草也。陆玑云：一名萝摩，幽州人，谓之雀瓢。别录云：雀瓢白汁，注虫蛇毒，即女青苗汁也，《唐本》草，别出萝摩条，非。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111107-o2y0h83","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613111107-o2y0h83"}},{"ID":"20240613111108-70rr7i3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613111108-70rr7i3","updated":"20240613111115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女青《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240613111108-5lhptco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111108-5lhptco","updated":"20240613111108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，平，有毒。主蛊毒，逐邪恶气，杀鬼温疟，辟不祥。一名雀瓢。蛇衔根也，生朱崖，八月采阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111122-bd99ekz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613111122-bd99ekz"}},{"ID":"20240613111123-066c6n1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613111123-066c6n1","updated":"20240613111128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女青《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613111123-rrz5wuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111123-rrz5wuu","updated":"20240613111123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，平，有毒。主蛊毒，逐邪恶气，杀鬼温疟，辟不祥。一名雀瓢。蛇衔根也，生朱崖。八月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111123-5128csu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111123-5128csu","updated":"20240613111123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若是蛇衔根，不应独生朱崖。俗用是草叶，别是一物，未详熟是。术云带此屑一两，则疫不犯，弥宜识真者。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111123-u9hs8in","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111123-u9hs8in","updated":"20240613111123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此草，即雀瓢也，叶似萝摩，两叶相对。子似瓢形，大如枣生平泽。茎、叶并臭。其蛇衔根，都非其类。又《别录》云∶叶嫩时，似萝摩，圆端大茎，实黑，茎、叶汁黄白，亦与前说相似。若是蛇衔根，何得苗生益州，根在朱崖，相去万里余也？《别录》云∶雀瓢白汁，主虫蛇毒，即女青苗汁也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111025-2m7ufff","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613111025-2m7ufff"}},{"ID":"20240613111026-skvn300","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613111026-skvn300","updated":"20240613111031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女青《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613111026-szonz5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111026-szonz5z","updated":"20240613111026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，平，有毒。主蛊毒，逐邪恶气，杀鬼，温疟，辟不祥。一名雀瓢。蛇衔根也。生朱崖。八月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111026-01tsc8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111026-01tsc8c","updated":"20240613111026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶若是蛇衔根，不应独生朱崖。俗用是草叶，别是一物，未详孰是。术云∶带此屑一两，则疫疠不犯，弥宜识真者。唐本注云∶此草即雀瓢也。叶似萝摩，两叶相对。子似瓢形，大如枣许，故名雀瓢。根似白薇。生平泽。茎、叶并臭。其蛇衔根，都非其类。又《别录》云∶叶嫩时似萝摩，圆端大茎，实黑，茎、叶汁黄白。亦与前说相似。若是蛇衔根，何得苗生益州，根在朱崖，相去万里余也？《别录）云∶雀瓢白汁，主虫蛇毒，即女青苗汁也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111026-ypdfxwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111026-ypdfxwp","updated":"20240613111026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶女青，使，味苦，无毒。能治温疟寒热，蛇衔为使。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111026-v1d6d25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111026-v1d6d25","updated":"20240613111026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经文具蛇衔条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111026-7mr397b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111026-7mr397b","updated":"20240613111026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肘后方∶辟瘟病。正月上寅日，捣女青末，三角缝囊盛，系前帐中，大吉。子母秘录∶治小腹皮青黑赤，不能喘息。即急用此方，并治吐痢卒死，用女青末纳口中酒服。亦治大人。紫灵南君南岳夫人内传治卒死。捣女青屑一钱，安喉中。以水或酒送下，立活也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111027-pv8i33u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613111027-pv8i33u"}},{"ID":"20240613111050-q5hluoc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613111050-q5hluoc","updated":"20240613111055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女青《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240613111050-fs4j0ul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111050-fs4j0ul","updated":"20240613111050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶圆而臭，两叶相对，结子似瓢，大如枣，根似白薇。味辛，平，有毒。主蛊毒，鬼气，瘟疟，虫蛇毒。八月采根，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613111050-whq7mnd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613111050-whq7mnd"}},{"ID":"20240613111051-85vpupt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111051-85vpupt"}}]}